# =============================================================================
# CS781 Legal Intelligence System — Code-Only .gitignore
# Tracks only code/phase1..phase7 (*.ipynb, *.py, README.md) and repo config.
# Excludes report/, PDFs, datasets, checkpoints, figures, and audit artifacts.
# =============================================================================

# --- 1. Reports, Submission Archive & LaTeX Build Artifacts ---
report/
report.tex
CS781-CP-*.zip
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# --- 2. Audit Packages, Logs, Spreadsheets & Figures ---
CS781_Project_Audit/
section3_audit/*.csv
section3_audit/*.md
section3_audit/*.png
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.html
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*_report.md
*_inventory.md

# --- 3. Model Checkpoints, Token Binaries & Raw Datasets ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
*.jsonl
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
data/
raw/
tokens/
checkpoints/
submissions/

# --- 4. Python, Jupyter & Virtual Environments ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# --- 5. OS & Editor Metadata ---
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- 6. Explicitly Ensure Code & Repo Config Are Tracked ---
!code/**/*.ipynb
!code/**/*.py
!code/**/README.md
!section3_audit/plot_data.py
!README.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
